    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοβρ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ]
		ὗς</span>, = foreg., <i><span class="en">
			Hippon.
			77
		</span></i>. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ός</span>, ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>greedy fellow</i>, applied
			to a beggar, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.219
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				775
			</span></i>: also as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοβρὴ
				κεφαλή</span> the head of a plant <i>that rests upon the
				ground</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				662
			</span></i> (variously expld. by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> and Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i>).</div>
